{"id":"28e86a5f0243a0ae","group":"29","path":"29/29-df-vocab.md","title":"词汇 τ","display":"df-vocab — 词汇 τ","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-df-vocab","aliases":["29-df-vocab"],"display":"df-vocab — 词汇 τ","depends_on":[],"revision_basis":"本次仅据用户提供的29(1).zip修订；既有原书定位及过往核对叙述为继承记录，未重新取得或查看DjVu原件","revision_verification":"数学类型与接口审查、静态结构及链接检查；未提交证明助理内核证书"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-df-vocab"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-df-vocab</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-vocab — 词汇 τ"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"revision_basis","html":"本次仅据用户提供的29(1).zip修订；既有原书定位及过往核对叙述为继承记录，未重新取得或查看DjVu原件"},{"key":"revision_verification","html":"数学类型与接口审查、静态结构及链接检查；未提交证明助理内核证书"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf R,\\mathsf C,\\mathsf F\">\\(\\mathsf R,\\mathsf C,\\mathsf F\\)</span> 是两两不交、与个体变量及逻辑构造标签不交的可数符号集；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf S=\\mathsf R\\cup\\mathsf C\\cup\\mathsf F\">\\(\\mathsf S=\\mathsf R\\cup\\mathsf C\\cup\\mathsf F\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ar}_0:\\mathsf R\\cup\\mathsf F\\to\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\">\\(\\operatorname{ar}_0:\\mathsf R\\cup\\mathsf F\\to\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\\)</span> 为固定元数映射；对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\geq1\">\\(k\\geq1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf R\\cap\\operatorname{ar}_0^{-1}(\\{k\\})\">\\(\\mathsf R\\cap\\operatorname{ar}_0^{-1}(\\{k\\})\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf F\\cap\\operatorname{ar}_0^{-1}(\\{k\\})\">\\(\\mathsf F\\cap\\operatorname{ar}_0^{-1}(\\{k\\})\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf C\">\\(\\mathsf C\\)</span> 均可数无穷。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu:\\mathsf S\\hookrightarrow\\mathbb N\">\\(\\nu:\\mathsf S\\hookrightarrow\\mathbb N\\)</span> 为固定单射。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R^{(k)}\">\\(R^{(k)}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f^{(k)}\">\\(f^{(k)}\\)</span> 分别表示满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ar}_0(R)=k\">\\(\\operatorname{ar}_0(R)=k\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ar}_0(f)=k\">\\(\\operatorname{ar}_0(f)=k\\)</span> 的带类型符号，不产生新的符号副本。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r,s,t\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(r,s,t\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Vert\">\\(\\Vert\\)</span> 为有限序列串接，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{rng}\">\\(\\operatorname{rng}\\)</span> 为序列分量集合。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau,\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Vocabulary}\">\\(\\tau,\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Vocabulary}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\subseteq\\mathsf S\">\\(D\\subseteq\\mathsf S\\)</span> 为有限集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\\in\\{\\mathsf R,\\mathsf C,\\mathsf F\\}\">\\(K\\in\\{\\mathsf R,\\mathsf C,\\mathsf F\\}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota\">\\(\\iota\\)</span> 是存在唯一见证时的定描述符。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Vocabulary}\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\langle R_1^{(a_1)},\\ldots,R_r^{(a_r)},c_1,\\ldots,c_s,f_1^{(b_1)},\\ldots,f_t^{(b_t)}\\rangle\\ \\middle|\\ \\begin{aligned}&amp;r,s,t\\in\\mathbb N,\\quad(R_1,\\ldots,R_r)\\in\\mathsf R^r,\\quad(c_1,\\ldots,c_s)\\in\\mathsf C^s,\\quad(f_1,\\ldots,f_t)\\in\\mathsf F^t,\\\\&amp;\\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,r\\}\\;a_i=\\operatorname{ar}_0(R_i),\\quad\\forall j\\in\\{1,\\ldots,t\\}\\;b_j=\\operatorname{ar}_0(f_j),\\\\&amp;|\\{R_1,\\ldots,R_r,c_1,\\ldots,c_s,f_1,\\ldots,f_t\\}|=r+s+t\\end{aligned}\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Vocabulary}\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\langle R_1^{(a_1)},\\ldots,R_r^{(a_r)},c_1,\\ldots,c_s,f_1^{(b_1)},\\ldots,f_t^{(b_t)}\\rangle\\ \\middle|\\ \\begin{aligned}&amp;r,s,t\\in\\mathbb N,\\quad(R_1,\\ldots,R_r)\\in\\mathsf R^r,\\quad(c_1,\\ldots,c_s)\\in\\mathsf C^s,\\quad(f_1,\\ldots,f_t)\\in\\mathsf F^t,\\\\&amp;\\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,r\\}\\;a_i=\\operatorname{ar}_0(R_i),\\quad\\forall j\\in\\{1,\\ldots,t\\}\\;b_j=\\operatorname{ar}_0(f_j),\\\\&amp;|\\{R_1,\\ldots,R_r,c_1,\\ldots,c_s,f_1,\\ldots,f_t\\}|=r+s+t\\end{aligned}\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{seq}_\\tau(\\mathsf R)\\coloneqq\\langle R_1,\\ldots,R_r\\rangle,\\quad\\operatorname{seq}_\\tau(\\mathsf C)\\coloneqq\\langle c_1,\\ldots,c_s\\rangle,\\quad\\operatorname{seq}_\\tau(\\mathsf F)\\coloneqq\\langle f_1,\\ldots,f_t\\rangle,\\quad\\tau=\\langle R_1^{(a_1)},\\ldots,R_r^{(a_r)},c_1,\\ldots,c_s,f_1^{(b_1)},\\ldots,f_t^{(b_t)}\\rangle.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{seq}_\\tau(\\mathsf R)\\coloneqq\\langle R_1,\\ldots,R_r\\rangle,\\quad\\operatorname{seq}_\\tau(\\mathsf C)\\coloneqq\\langle c_1,\\ldots,c_s\\rangle,\\quad\\operatorname{seq}_\\tau(\\mathsf F)\\coloneqq\\langle f_1,\\ldots,f_t\\rangle,\\quad\\tau=\\langle R_1^{(a_1)},\\ldots,R_r^{(a_r)},c_1,\\ldots,c_s,f_1^{(b_1)},\\ldots,f_t^{(b_t)}\\rangle.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Rel}(\\tau)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{rng}(\\operatorname{seq}_\\tau(\\mathsf R)),\\quad\\operatorname{Const}(\\tau)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{rng}(\\operatorname{seq}_\\tau(\\mathsf C)),\\quad\\operatorname{Func}(\\tau)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{rng}(\\operatorname{seq}_\\tau(\\mathsf F)),\\quad\\operatorname{Sym}(\\tau)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Rel}(\\tau)\\cup\\operatorname{Const}(\\tau)\\cup\\operatorname{Func}(\\tau).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Rel}(\\tau)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{rng}(\\operatorname{seq}_\\tau(\\mathsf R)),\\quad\\operatorname{Const}(\\tau)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{rng}(\\operatorname{seq}_\\tau(\\mathsf C)),\\quad\\operatorname{Func}(\\tau)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{rng}(\\operatorname{seq}_\\tau(\\mathsf F)),\\quad\\operatorname{Sym}(\\tau)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Rel}(\\tau)\\cup\\operatorname{Const}(\\tau)\\cup\\operatorname{Func}(\\tau).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ar}(P)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\operatorname{ar}_0(P),&amp;P\\in\\mathsf R\\cup\\mathsf F,\\\\0,&amp;P\\in\\mathsf C,\\end{cases}\\qquad a(P)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{ar}(P),\\qquad\\operatorname{arity}(P)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{ar}(P).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ar}(P)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\operatorname{ar}_0(P),&amp;P\\in\\mathsf R\\cup\\mathsf F,\\\\0,&amp;P\\in\\mathsf C,\\end{cases}\\qquad a(P)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{ar}(P),\\qquad\\operatorname{arity}(P)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{ar}(P).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"P\\in\\tau\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ P\\in\\operatorname{Sym}(\\tau),\\qquad\\sigma\\subseteq\\tau\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\operatorname{Sym}(\\sigma)\\subseteq\\operatorname{Sym}(\\tau).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[P\\in\\tau\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ P\\in\\operatorname{Sym}(\\tau),\\qquad\\sigma\\subseteq\\tau\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\operatorname{Sym}(\\sigma)\\subseteq\\operatorname{Sym}(\\tau).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{seq}_{\\tau\\cup\\sigma}(K)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{seq}_\\tau(K)\\Vert\\langle P\\in\\operatorname{seq}_\\sigma(K)\\mid P\\notin\\operatorname{Sym}(\\tau)\\rangle.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{seq}_{\\tau\\cup\\sigma}(K)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{seq}_\\tau(K)\\Vert\\langle P\\in\\operatorname{seq}_\\sigma(K)\\mid P\\notin\\operatorname{Sym}(\\tau)\\rangle.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{sort}_\\nu(D)\\coloneqq\\iota\\langle d_1,\\ldots,d_m\\rangle\\;\\bigl(m=|D|\\land\\{d_1,\\ldots,d_m\\}=D\\land\\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,m-1\\}\\;\\nu(d_i)&lt;\\nu(d_{i+1})\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{sort}_\\nu(D)\\coloneqq\\iota\\langle d_1,\\ldots,d_m\\rangle\\;\\bigl(m=|D|\\land\\{d_1,\\ldots,d_m\\}=D\\land\\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,m-1\\}\\;\\nu(d_i)&lt;\\nu(d_{i+1})\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{vocab}(D)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{sort}_\\nu(D\\cap\\mathsf R)\\Vert\\operatorname{sort}_\\nu(D\\cap\\mathsf C)\\Vert\\operatorname{sort}_\\nu(D\\cap\\mathsf F),\\qquad\\tau\\cup D\\coloneqq\\tau\\cup\\operatorname{vocab}(D),\\qquad D\\cup\\tau\\coloneqq\\operatorname{vocab}(D)\\cup\\tau.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{vocab}(D)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{sort}_\\nu(D\\cap\\mathsf R)\\Vert\\operatorname{sort}_\\nu(D\\cap\\mathsf C)\\Vert\\operatorname{sort}_\\nu(D\\cap\\mathsf F),\\qquad\\tau\\cup D\\coloneqq\\tau\\cup\\operatorname{vocab}(D),\\qquad D\\cup\\tau\\coloneqq\\operatorname{vocab}(D)\\cup\\tau.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\tau\\cap\\sigma\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Sym}(\\tau)\\cap\\operatorname{Sym}(\\sigma),\\qquad\\tau\\cap D\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Sym}(\\tau)\\cap D,\\qquad D\\cap\\tau\\coloneqq D\\cap\\operatorname{Sym}(\\tau).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\tau\\cap\\sigma\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Sym}(\\tau)\\cap\\operatorname{Sym}(\\sigma),\\qquad\\tau\\cap D\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Sym}(\\tau)\\cap D,\\qquad D\\cap\\tau\\coloneqq D\\cap\\operatorname{Sym}(\\tau).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本次来源边界：以上原书定位与过往核对叙述继承自所给文件，不表示本次重新查看了原书或完成机器证明；本次修补以现有文本的类型、条件和依赖闭合为依据。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathsf R,\\mathsf C,\\mathsf F","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf S=\\mathsf R\\cup\\mathsf C\\cup\\mathsf F","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ar}_0:\\mathsf R\\cup\\mathsf F\\to\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}","display":false},{"tex":"k\\geq1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf R\\cap\\operatorname{ar}_0^{-1}(\\{k\\})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf F\\cap\\operatorname{ar}_0^{-1}(\\{k\\})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf C","display":false},{"tex":"\\nu:\\mathsf S\\hookrightarrow\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"R^{(k)}","display":false},{"tex":"f^{(k)}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ar}_0(R)=k","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ar}_0(f)=k","display":false},{"tex":"r,s,t\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\Vert","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{rng}","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau,\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Vocabulary}","display":false},{"t